Project Journal

Project Title

AI Smart Surveillance System Using ESP32-CAM

Author: Prince Kumar

Total Project Duration: 41 Hours 32 Minutes 55 Seconds

---

Project Overview

The AI Smart Surveillance System is an IoT-based hardware project developed using an ESP32-CAM and a PIR motion sensor. The system continuously monitors an area for motion. When movement is detected, the ESP32-CAM captures an image, activates an LED and buzzer, and can send the captured image to a mobile device through Wi-Fi. The project demonstrates embedded systems, IoT communication, sensor integration, and smart security technology.

